.Dd March 12, 2026
.Dt DMA_ALLOC_COHERENT 9
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm dma_alloc_coherent ,
.Nm dma_free_coherent
.Nd allocate and free coherent DMA buffers
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In sys/dma.h
.Ft void *
.Fn dma_alloc_coherent "size_t size" "dma_addr_t *dma_handle"
.Ft void
.Fn dma_free_coherent "void *cpu_addr" "size_t size"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Fn dma_alloc_coherent
function allocates page-aligned, zeroed memory suitable for coherent DMA
and returns both the CPU mapping and the device-visible DMA address.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr dma_map 9
